data: {"type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT", "timestamp": 1793218385681, "messageId": "bf3012865b", "delta": "The recommended design is **A1**, a deep doublet with an absorption cascade. It covers 100% of heating and cooling demands at **41 €/MWh** for heat and **58 €/MWh** for cold, saving **82.2%** CO₂ compared to gas. This system uses the reservoir at 87 °C (2500 m) efficiently, keeping the doublet busy longer during summer cooling. Compared to the gas reference (A4) or shallow doublet (A2), A1 offers the lowest costs and highest emissions reduction while meeting all demand targets."}

